@startuml
 title Login sequence
actor user as U
participant "client web/mobile" as C
participant Kong as G
participant IAM as I
database "SQL Server" as D

U -> C: enters email and password
C -> G: POST /API/v1/auth/login
G -> I: Reenvía request
I -> D: looks profile and validates credencial
D --> I: profile / status
I --> G: JWT and session or error
G --> C: Respuesta
C --> U: access or message of error
@enduml

